# The Price of Peace (Windurst 1-3, mission.windurst.the_price_of_peace). A level 10 Warrior of Windurst who has
# completed 1-1 and 1-2 (a GM). Section 1 (no mission current): Janshura-Rashura of Port Windurst plays 78; its finish
# with option 0 and 1 does nothing, with option 2 begins the mission. Section 2 (1-3 current): Janshura-Rashura plays
# 110; Nine of Clubs, Puo Rhen and Ten of Clubs play 74, 79 and 80, the events of The Heart of the Matter's last
# section, which has no NONE check in the Lua (a kept bug) and so answers first. Status 1 (Windurst Waters): the quest
# Food for Thought answers before Price's own events: Kenapa-Keppa plays its 310, Ohbiru-Dohbiru its 308 (its finish
# sets ohbiruProg 1) and, at status 3, its 309; Leepe-Hoppe plays Price's progress event 140, whose finish gives the
# Food and Drink Offerings (status 2). Status 2: Leepe-Hoppe plays 142; in Giddeus Laa Mozi plays cutscene 45 and Ghoo
# Pakya 49: each finish takes its offering (a second finish with none left changes nothing) and the second offering sets
# status 3. Status 3: Ghoo Pakya plays 52 and Laa Mozi 48 over their own events; in Waters Ohbiru-Dohbiru plays Food for
# Thought's 309 (not Price's 144) and the trigger area at the Rhinostery plays 146 (status 4). Status 4: Leepe-Hoppe
# plays 147 (important once); Janshura-Rashura plays 114, whose finish completes the mission (1000 gil, rank 2).
# Completed (no mission, Lost for Words not completed): Nine of Clubs 117, Puo Rhen 116 and Ten of Clubs 118.
lists PortWindurst/Janshura-Rashura/onTrigger PortWindurst/Nine_of_Clubs/onTrigger PortWindurst/Puo_Rhen/onTrigger PortWindurst/Ten_of_Clubs/onTrigger PortWindurst/onEventFinish/78 PortWindurst/onEventFinish/114 WindurstWaters/Kenapa-Keppa/onTrigger WindurstWaters/Ohbiru-Dohbiru/onTrigger WindurstWaters/Leepe-Hoppe/onTrigger WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/140 WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/146 WindurstWaters/onTriggerAreaEnter/1 Giddeus/Laa_Mozi/onTrigger Giddeus/Ghoo_Pakya/onTrigger Giddeus/onEventFinish/45 Giddeus/onEventFinish/49
